
' Lifecycle of one thing (a DAG run, a ticket, a partition). Start from preambles/house.puml +
' this file. One state per box, every transition labelled with the event that causes it;
' a failure state is filled <<failure>>.

hide empty description
title State diagram for <thing> lifecycle (as-of date)

[*] --> Replace_first : Replace: created
state "Replace: first state" as Replace_first
state "Replace: working" as Replace_working
state "Replace: done" as Replace_done
state "Replace: failed" as Replace_failed <<failure>>
Replace_first --> Replace_working : Replace: event
Replace_working --> Replace_done : Replace: event
Replace_working --> Replace_failed : Replace: event
Replace_failed --> Replace_first : Replace: retry
Replace_done --> [*]

legend right
  |= Mark |= Meaning |
  | rounded box | state |
  |<#FADBD8>| failure state |
  | circle / ringed dot | first / last state |
endlegend
@enduml
